  "changes": [
    "Debian 2022.10.3-5+deb13u3 security patches applied before native adaptation",
    "Native callable entry instead of CLI/getopt; explicit requested byte size and dry flag",
    "Original forensic no-write mount plus additional mandatory hibernation and logfile-clean checks",
    "No force on dirty volumes: confirmation bypass occurs only AFTER checks",
    "Reset allocation search state for repeated calls; UTF-8 conversion only",
    "Integer-only display; no floating point or Linux device I/O",
    "Private namespace applied by build; supplied native bounded block operations and libc subset"
  ]
